{"title":"Summary","puid":"c-nateng-6-gb/3u3fez","path":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/level-04","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025","speaker":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"imageButtons","instruction":{"text":"Select all the images that are a <b>setting</b> in the story."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleButtons":true,"image":{"width":130},"atoms":{"a":"","b":[{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_02_setting.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_01_setting.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_05_setting.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/setting_a.lsg"},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/setting_b.lsg"},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/setting_c.lsg"}]}},{"trainer":"dragSort","instruction":{"text":"Select the images to hear a short summary of each of the chapters. Then, drag the images into their correct order."},"soundMode":"a","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_01.lsg","sound":"Jake is annoyed that he sits next to Norbert all the time."},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_02.lsg","sound":"Norbert doesn’t like school and feels left out."},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_03.lsg","sound":"Norbert and Jake get in a fight while playing football."},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_04.lsg","sound":"Jake feels treated unfairly by the teachers."},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/level_05.lsg","sound":"Jake and Norbert clean up the rubbish and play the drums."}]},{"trainer":"imageButtons","instruction":{"text":"Which character said it? Select the correct image."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleAtoms":true,"shuffleButtons":false,"image":{"width":130},"atoms":[{"a":"“<i>The bus is always crowded when I get on. I wonder what it’s like to be the first kid to get on the school bus. All those empty rows and seats to choose from.</i>”","b":[{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/jake.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/norbert.lsg"}]},{"a":"“<i>I hate school. Nobody wants to talk to me, let alone be my friend. I spend most of my time trying to avoid my classmates and teachers. Nothing good ever happens when I try to talk to people.</i>”","b":[{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/jake.lsg"},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/norbert.lsg","correct":true}]},{"a":"“<i>I can’t believe I just got into a fight. He attacked me out of nowhere! What was I supposed to do? I had to fight back. The teachers are definitely going to take my side, I mean, he attacked me and anything else would be unfair.</i>”","b":[{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/jake.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/norbert.lsg"}]}]},{"trainer":"buttons","instruction":{"text":"Select the correct answer."},"shuffleButtons":true,"trueFalseMode":true,"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/jake_norbert_test.lsg","soundMode":"a","atoms":[{"a":"By the end of the story, Jake and Norbert are best friends.","b":false,"feedback":{"end":{"text":"Jake and Norbert are <i>not</i> best friends, but neither are they mean to each other. Their experience helps them build empathy for each other.","speaker":true}}},{"a":"The story has a <b>well-defined</b> ending.","b":false,"hint":{"text":"A <b>well-defined</b> ending means that everything has a nice conclusion. All the questions posed by the story have an answer, and you don’t wonder what happens to the characters.","speaker":true},"feedback":{"end":{"text":"This story does not have a well-defined ending. Jake and Norbert do not resolve some of their issues and do not become friends. Norbert’s situation is better but clearly not fixed.","speaker":true}}}]},{"trainer":"soundButtons","instruction":{"text":"Listen and select the correct answer."},"shuffleButtons":true,"trueFalseMode":true,"lsg":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/lsg/jake_norbert_test.lsg","soundMode":"a","atoms":{"a":"What is the <b>theme</b> of the story?","b":[{"sound":"Treat people with kindness, you never know what they are dealing with.","correct":true},{"sound":"Good things come to those who wait."}]}}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Reading Comprehension - Fiction","path":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/topic","puid":"c-nateng-6-gb/ncvx1b"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Story: Jake and Norbert (2)","path":"/../c-nateng-6-gb/topic-02-reading-comprehension-fiction/block-02a-fiction-2/block","puid":"c-nateng-6-gb/1qpyby"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Listen and select the correct answer.","etag":"38a6-14301"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Select all the images that are a <b>setting</b> in the story.","etag":"348c-19197"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Select the correct answer.","etag":"8cd7-11853"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f3_2025/Select the images to hear a short summary of each of the chapters. Then, drag the images into their correct order.","etag":"06cd-44685"},{"fi